      "title": "START HERE - audio-driven latent continuation",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Upload your full audio and a portrait, describe the scene, then Run. The sampler automatically creates overlapping H3 windows and exports one 24 FPS video at the audio duration.\n\n**243 frames / 39 overlap** is the tested default. No repeated pixel re-encoding; held latents are preserved. This reduces one source of drift, but does not guarantee unlimited identity retention or perfect lip sync.\n\n**SOL** is optional native ComfyUI attention. The Turbo control protects the first/final step. **FirstBlockCache** is a separate approximate switch; leave it off for quality comparisons. Use 512x768 for faster drafts or 832x1248 for detail.\n\nRequires current ComfyUI, comfy-kitchen >=0.2.37, SECoursesAudioTools and ComfyUI-TeaCache. Read the output JSON for window boundaries and timings."
      ]
    }
